{{DISPLAYTITLE:Optimal free-to-play quest guide}}
{{Otheruses|def=no|the [[Ironman Mode|Ironman]] variant of this guide|Optimal quest guide/Free-to-play/Ironman}}

As few free-to-play quests have skill requirements, quests in this guide can mostly be grouped together by region.

This list does not recommend specific combat level requirements, and experienced players should be able to do all quests except for [[Dragon Slayer I]] without training skills in between doing the quests. This requires knowledge of how to safe spot [[Count Draynor]], however, so inexperienced players may wish to train combat stats before taking on this quest.

After completing all quests except for Dragon Slayer I, it is recommended that players focus on other gameplay, since this final free-to-play quest requires significantly higher stats than any other available quest. See [[Dragon Slayer I|the quest guide]] for an indication of this quest's difficulty.



==Grand Exchange==
Some items are recommended to be bought on the [[Grand Exchange]] found in northern [[Varrock]] where possible. For some items, gathering the materials yourself will be more time consuming or require levels you may not have. Alternative methods of obtaining these items may be given throughout the guide. Completing the [[Stronghold of Security]] in nearby [[Barbarian Village]] will reward you with {{Coins|10000}}, enough money to cover the items listed below. Note that this is not a definitive list of the items required to complete all quests, but highlights some of the more difficult to acquire items.

